      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹32.86 (vs ₹34.72 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹32.86 (down from ₹34.72 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹20.4b (up 19% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹1.94b (down 5.3% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 9.5% (down from 12% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 2% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 21% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
